graph LR
    T0([T=0 Now]) -->|48h horizon| TGT[(Target T+48h)]
    T0 -->|24h horizon| T24[T+24h]
    T0 -->|1h horizon| T1[T+1h]
    T0 -->|15min horizon| T15[T+15min]
    T47([T=47h Now]) -->|1h horizon| TGT
    TGT --- NOTE[Same moment; converging forecasts]

    classDef primary fill:#00D9C5,stroke:#1E3A5F,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef secondary fill:#1E3A5F,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef accent fill:#e6f7f5,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#000

    class T0,T47 primary
    class TGT secondary
    class T24,T1,T15 accent
    class NOTE accent